sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Agent
    participant T as Tool
    U->>A: Fix the failing test
    activate A
    A->>T: run cargo test
    T-->>A: 1 failed
    Note over A,T: reads the failure
    loop until green
        A->>T: edit and rerun
    end
    alt passes
        A-->>U: Done
    else still failing
        A-->>U: Needs help
    end
    deactivate A
